WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:03.360
Since we can't catch them then don't catch them.

00:04.600 --> 00:10.000
Break up the volunteers integrate them into the garrison have officers of battalion rank and above take charge.

00:10.080 --> 00:15.960
So spies have no way to organize together as units add more personnel strictly guard the gates.

00:16.320 --> 00:17.720
Should be safe.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.480
Your Highness having everyone hand over their command my men are fine with it.

00:26.240 --> 00:31.600
But other leaders may not agree this matter.

00:31.680 --> 00:37.360
Relies on Commander Liu please, Commander Liu give the brothers advance notice when my men arrive.

00:37.440 --> 00:40.600
To arrange entry set an example.

00:42.920 --> 00:48.627
Leaders hesitation is normal but the hesitant often follow the loudest voice.

00:50.760 --> 00:53.280
What if someone absolutely refuses?

00:55.680 --> 00:58.880
Then please turn back.

01:02.480 --> 01:03.880
Yes.

01:20.480 --> 01:25.760
Damn it I won't take this insult we brothers rushed here isn't it to fight the Wuzhao?

01:26.000 --> 01:32.280
Old Liu you can fool everyone but don't fool yourself everyone said to get benefits together.

01:33.080 --> 01:34.240
You didn't take more for yourself, did you?

01:34.320 --> 01:40.760
No those bastards in Yiyang I'm done serving them let's go you you all.

01:40.840 --> 01:42.200
Go.

01:44.000 --> 01:53.000
Many volunteer soldiers angrily chose to depart, yet a small portion, influenced by Wang Dadao, agreed to enter the city and accept military governance. The Yiyang garrison received reinforcements: approximately three thousand volunteer troops entered the city.

